      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    credit_sales = 40000\n    cost_of_goods_sold = 30000\n    accounts_receivable = 3000\n    beginning_inventory = 1500\n    ending_inventory = 2000\n    accounts_payable = 4000\n    days_in_year = 365\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    average_inventory = (beginning_inventory + ending_inventory) / 2\n    days_inventory_outstanding = (\n        average_inventory / cost_of_goods_sold\n    ) * days_in_year\n    days_sales_outstanding = (\n        accounts_receivable / credit_sales\n    ) * days_in_year\n    days_payable_outstanding = (\n        accounts_payable / cost_of_goods_sold\n    ) * days_in_year\n\n    cash_conversion_cycle = (\n        days_inventory_outstanding\n        + days_sales_outstanding\n        - days_payable_outstanding\n    )\n    answer = round(cash_conversion_cycle, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
